==Trivia==
*Kasli the Bane was the first Cat Unit to have the Surge Immune and Curse abilities.
*Prior to [[Version 9.8 Update|Version 9.8]], Kasli the Bane's English description mistakenly stated that her ability was Savage Blow instead of Surge Attacks.
*Kasli the Bane won the [https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=O9OyLCBB7bU 2025 Special Achievement Nyaward], with a speech accompanying her victory:
<blockquote>
As a daughter of pure chaos and the personification of disaster, my reputation inspires a lot in others... fear... terror... but this level of praise is a first. It means a great deal to me that you have looked past the horrifying specters possessing my soul and recognize the effort it takes to make sure that their curses only target the enemy. True, the struggle to keep these evil spirits leashed may leave a few blind spots in my attack... so, I'd like to use this platform to apologize to all my former allies that I've accidentally vaporized in the past. Thank you, cat army, for your trust in my unpredictable powers!
</blockquote>

